# Data files that are not Python modules but are part of the application (issue #32).
#
# Templates and static assets are resolved relative to the installed `encore` package by
# `encore/api/html.py`, so a distribution without them imports fine and fails on the first
# page view. The unit tests run against the source tree, which is how this stayed invisible
# until the installer milestone made "installed" a thing that happens.
recursive-include encore/templates *.html
recursive-include encore/static *
include examples/config.yaml
